COMMENT ON TABLE public.vocabulary_group IS 'Named grouping within a controlled_vocabulary namespace (e.g. regime_hmm/trending, regime_cross_sectional_equity/low_vol). Groups are independent and may overlap - a code can belong to more than one group in the same namespace (e.g. regime_hmm/trending_up belongs to both trending and bullish_bias). This is why the shape is a join table (vocabulary_group_member) rather than a single parent_code column on controlled_vocabulary.';


